{{- define "page:tierlist" -}}<article><h1>{{ .Label }} tier list{{ if .HasPartition }}, patch {{ .Patch }}{{ end }}</h1><p>{{ .Intro }}</p>{{ if .HasPartition }}<p>Patch <strong>{{ .Patch }}</strong> &middot; {{ .Region }} &middot; queue {{ .Queue }} &middot; bracket {{ .Bracket }} &middot; source window {{ .Window }} &middot; generated {{ .Generated }}</p>{{ end }}<h2>Patch</h2>{{ template "patchSwitcher" .Patches }}{{ if .HasSample }}{{ template "sampleSizeNotice" .Notice }}<p>n above is the sum of the game counts of the published cells in this table, so it counts matches rather than players: champions whose cells fall below the threshold are withheld and are not counted in it.</p>{{ if .HasBar }}{{ template "nojsBar" .Bar }}{{ end }}{{ if .HasCompare }}{{ template "comparePanel" .Compare }}{{ end }}{{ template "tableIsland" .Island }}{{ if .HasPageNav }}{{ template "nojsPager" .PageNav }}{{ end }}<script type="module" src="/_astro/TableIsland.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.UqXLqAt9.js"></script><p>{{ .Note }}</p>{{ if .HasUnmeasured }}<p>{{ .UnmeasuredNote }}</p>{{ end }}<p>Tier order is derived from win and pick rate together; the letters are a reading aid, not an official ranking. {{ template "fallbackTierBadge" .SPlusBadge }} marks the strongest cells in a snapshot.</p><h2>Champion pages in {{ .LabelLower }}</h2>{{ template "championLinks" .Links }}{{ else }}{{ template "emptyState" .Empty }}{{ end }}<h2>What this table is</h2><p>{{ .Tail }}</p><p><a href="/">All roles</a> &middot; <a href="/matchups/{{ .Slug }}">{{ .Label }} matchups</a> &middot; <a href="/about">How these numbers are produced</a></p></article>{{ if .HasArchive }}{{ .Archive }}{{ end }}{{- end -}}
